W("Who rushed in and out bringing Tricki's day bed, night bed, cushions and toys?", 2, "The maids of Mrs Pumphrey's household; the entire staff had been roused. (2)", "E"),
W("True or false: Tricki was given medicines at the surgery. Give the evidence.", 2, "False. The text says 'He had no medicinal treatment of any kind'; he got better by running about with the other dogs and eating at feeding time. (2)", "E"),
W("What did Mrs Pumphrey do as Herriot drove away with Tricki?", 2, "With a despairing cry she threw an armful of Tricki's little coats through the car window; everybody was in tears. (2)", "E"),
